{"version":"6.9","hitCount":1,"request":{"queryString":"EXT_ID:35748039","resultType":"core","cursorMark":"*","pageSize":25,"sort":"","synonym":false},"resultList":{"result":[{"id":"35748039","source":"MED","pmid":"35748039","doi":"10.1021/acs.jnatprod.2c00065","title":"Triculamin: An Unusual Lasso Peptide with Potent Antimycobacterial Activity.","authorString":"Andersen FD, Pedersen KD, Wilkens Juhl D, Mygind T, Chopin P, B Svenningsen E, Poulsen TB, Braad Lund M, Schramm A, Gotfredsen CH, Tørring T.","authorList":{"author":[{"fullName":"Andersen FD","lastName":"Andersen","firstName":"Frederikke D","initials":"FD","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Biological and Chemical Engineering, Aarhus University, 8000 Aarhus C, Denmark."}]}},{"fullName":"Pedersen KD","lastName":"Pedersen","firstName":"Katja D","initials":"KD","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Chemistry, Technical University of Denmark, 2800 Kgs. Lyngby, Denmark."}]}},{"fullName":"Wilkens Juhl D","lastName":"Wilkens Juhl","firstName":"Dennis","initials":"D","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Chemistry, Aarhus University, 8000 Aarhus C, Denmark."},{"affiliation":"Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Centre, Aarhus University, 8000 Aarhus C, Denmark."}]}},{"fullName":"Mygind T","lastName":"Mygind","firstName":"Tobias","initials":"T","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Biological and Chemical Engineering, Aarhus University, 8000 Aarhus C, Denmark."}]}},{"fullName":"Chopin P","lastName":"Chopin","firstName":"Paul","initials":"P","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Biological and Chemical Engineering, Aarhus University, 8000 Aarhus C, Denmark."}]}},{"fullName":"B Svenningsen E","lastName":"B Svenningsen","firstName":"Esben","initials":"E","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0001-5118-6499"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Chemistry, Aarhus University, 8000 Aarhus C, Denmark."}]}},{"fullName":"Poulsen TB","lastName":"Poulsen","firstName":"Thomas B","initials":"TB","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0002-0763-9996"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Chemistry, Aarhus University, 8000 Aarhus C, Denmark."}]}},{"fullName":"Braad Lund M","lastName":"Braad Lund","firstName":"Marie","initials":"M","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Biology, Aarhus University, 8000 Aarhus C, Denmark."}]}},{"fullName":"Schramm A","lastName":"Schramm","firstName":"Andreas","initials":"A","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0002-7614-9616"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Biology, Aarhus University, 8000 Aarhus C, Denmark."}]}},{"fullName":"Gotfredsen CH","lastName":"Gotfredsen","firstName":"Charlotte H","initials":"CH","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0002-7386-119X"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Chemistry, Technical University of Denmark, 2800 Kgs. Lyngby, Denmark."}]}},{"fullName":"Tørring T","lastName":"Tørring","firstName":"Thomas","initials":"T","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0001-5257-2121"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Biological and Chemical Engineering, Aarhus University, 8000 Aarhus C, Denmark."}]}}]},"authorIdList":{"authorId":[{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0001-5118-6499"},{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0001-5257-2121"},{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0002-0763-9996"},{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0002-3416-5597"},{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0002-7386-119X"},{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0002-7614-9616"},{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0003-1543-1009"}]},"dataLinksTagsList":{"dataLinkstag":["altmetrics","related_data"]},"journalInfo":{"issue":"6","volume":"85","journalIssueId":3379595,"dateOfPublication":"2022 Jun","monthOfPublication":6,"yearOfPublication":2022,"journal":{"medlineAbbreviation":"J Nat Prod","title":"Journal of natural products","essn":"1520-6025","issn":"0163-3864","nlmid":"7906882","isoabbreviation":"J Nat Prod"},"printPublicationDate":"2022-06-01"},"pubYear":"2022","pageInfo":"1514-1521","abstractText":"Lasso peptides are ribosomally synthesized and post-translationally modified peptides (RiPPs) produced by microorganisms. Here we show that the two natural products triculamin and alboverticillin, originally isolated in 1967 and 1958, respectively, with potent and specific activity against mycobacteria are in fact the same lasso peptide. We solved the structure using 2D NMR spectroscopy and expanded on the previously reported bioactivity. Through genome sequencing, we identify the responsible biosynthetic gene clusters, which curiously revealed that, unlike any known lasso peptides, their precursor peptides appear to have a follower instead of a leader peptide.","affiliation":"Department of Biological and Chemical Engineering, Aarhus University, 8000 Aarhus C, Denmark.","publicationStatus":"ppublish","language":"eng","pubModel":"Print-Electronic","pubTypeList":{"pubType":["Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't","Review","Journal Article"]},"grantsList":{"grant":[{"agency":"Uddannelses- og Forskningsministeriet","grantId":"AU-2010-612-181","orderIn":0},{"agency":"Carlsbergfondet","grantId":"CF17-0854","orderIn":0},{"agency":"Villum Fonden","grantId":"23223","orderIn":0}]},"meshHeadingList":{"meshHeading":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Peptides","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"CH","qualifierName":"chemistry"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Biological Products"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Protein Processing, Post-Translational"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Multigene Family"}]},"chemicalList":{"chemical":[{"name":"Peptides","registryNumber":"0"},{"name":"Biological Products","registryNumber":"0"}]},"subsetList":{"subset":[{"code":"IM","name":"Index Medicus"}]},"fullTextUrlList":{"fullTextUrl":[{"availability":"Subscription required","availabilityCode":"S","documentStyle":"doi","site":"DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jnatprod.2c00065"}]},"isOpenAccess":"N","inEPMC":"N","inPMC":"N","citedByCount":18,"hasReferences":"Y","hasTextMinedTerms":"Y","hasDbCrossReferences":"Y","dbCrossReferenceList":{"dbName":["CHEMBL","INTERPRO"]},"hasPDF":"N","hasBook":"N","hasSuppl":"N","hasLabsLinks":"Y","hasData":"Y","authMan":"N","epmcAuthMan":"N","nihAuthMan":"N","hasTMAccessionNumbers":"N","dateOfCompletion":"2022-06-27","dateOfCreation":"2022-06-24","dateOfRevision":"2022-07-10","electronicPublicationDate":"2022-06-15","firstPublicationDate":"2022-06-15","firstIndexDate":"2022-06-25","hasEvaluations":"N"}]}}